{
  "Name": "HP OpenView Network Node Manager Toolbar.exe CGI Cookie Handling Buffer Overflow",
  "Description": "This module exploits a stack buffer overflow in HP OpenView Network Node Manager 7.0 and 7.53. By sending a CGI request with a specially OvOSLocale cookie to Toolbar.exe, an attacker may be able to execute arbitrary code. Please note that this module only works against a specific build (i.e. NNM 7.53_01195)",
